WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.830
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.100 --> 00:29.270
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.500 --> 00:32.910
[Episode 12]

4
00:58.720 --> 01:01.740
♪ Watch me leap forward ♪

5
01:02.200 --> 01:03.990
♪ Fall and rise ♪

6
01:04.019 --> 01:06.240
♪ I am brave ♪

7
01:07.070 --> 01:10.690
♪ You will find, find your way ♪

8
01:11.280 --> 01:12.430
This is for you.

9
01:11.990 --> 01:13.480
♪ Win or lose ♪

10
01:14.150 --> 01:18.640
♪ I'm fighting through to the end ♪

11
01:19.810 --> 01:24.030
♪ Just to breathe again ♪

12
01:27.789 --> 01:28.789
This is the place.

13
01:29.510 --> 01:30.230
Guys,

14
01:30.230 --> 01:32.070
please stop what you're doing.

15
01:32.400 --> 01:33.310
Today,

16
01:33.310 --> 01:35.229
we have a new member joining our publicity team,

17
01:35.229 --> 01:36.200
Song Baiwei.

18
01:36.400 --> 01:37.710
She has prepared a

19
01:37.710 --> 01:38.920
charity sale and fundraising plan.

20
01:38.920 --> 01:40.850
Let's listen to what she has to say.

21
01:40.920 --> 01:42.870
Welcome! Great! Welcome!

22
01:51.039 --> 01:52.039
Here's the thing.

23
01:52.530 --> 01:53.479
Previously,

24
01:53.590 --> 01:54.710
I thought of a plan.

25
01:55.160 --> 01:57.130
Our country is in a time of crisis.

26
01:57.160 --> 01:58.560
You can take a look first.

27
01:59.070 --> 02:00.760
Since I am good at painting,

28
02:01.450 --> 02:03.220
I plan to hold a charity sale.

29
02:06.120 --> 02:06.640
Baiwei.

30
02:06.640 --> 02:07.230
Go on.

31
02:07.410 --> 02:09.120
Your painting is in the newspaper again. Look!

32
02:09.120 --> 02:10.380
It's in the newspaper!

33
02:10.840 --> 02:11.640
That's great!

34
02:11.960 --> 02:12.680
Let me see.

35
02:13.600 --> 02:14.530
What does it say?

36
02:16.960 --> 02:17.750
This is good.

37
02:18.120 --> 02:18.840
Yeah.

38
02:22.680 --> 02:25.840
Commander Ning compensates a fallen subordinate

39
02:25.860 --> 02:27.790
and adopts his orphaned daughter.

40
02:35.040 --> 02:35.829
Let's see.

41
02:36.040 --> 02:36.829
Let's see.

42
02:37.910 --> 02:38.610
Go over there.

43
02:38.610 --> 02:39.480
Let's go. Let's go.

44
02:39.480 --> 02:40.290
Let's appreciate it.

45
02:40.290 --> 02:41.090
What's wrong?

46
02:42.190 --> 02:43.030
Nothing.

47
02:43.570 --> 02:45.180
Why aren't you heading home to rest?

48
02:45.180 --> 02:45.980
Didn't you say

49
02:46.400 --> 02:47.560
that recently

50
02:47.560 --> 02:50.120
you've been driving the cinema boss to and from work

51
02:50.120 --> 02:52.120
just to get us this activity room?

52
02:52.920 --> 02:53.970
Aren't you tired?

53
02:53.990 --> 02:54.990
I'm not tired.

54
02:55.590 --> 02:57.790
Watching you write is my way of resting.

55
03:01.310 --> 03:02.120
Baiwei,

56
03:03.400 --> 03:06.070
let's go watch a movie tomorrow.

57
03:07.190 --> 03:08.030
I'm not going.

58
03:09.120 --> 03:09.910
Why?

59
03:12.240 --> 03:13.430
Just the two of us watching a movie...

60
03:13.430 --> 03:14.470
that's so boring.

61
03:14.680 --> 03:15.880
If you're so capable,

62
03:16.550 --> 03:18.320
invite everyone to go.

63
03:21.079 --> 03:23.800
Tomorrow I'm treating everyone to a movie!

64
03:24.220 --> 03:25.570
Great!

65
03:26.120 --> 03:27.310
That's wonderful!

66
03:32.720 --> 03:33.280
Dad...

67
03:35.200 --> 03:36.200
Go home right now.

68
03:36.710 --> 03:37.680
Not now.

69
03:37.900 --> 03:39.630
I'll go back when I'm done here.

70
03:40.870 --> 03:42.130
What are you busy with?

71
03:42.590 --> 03:44.000
Hanging out with these people

72
03:44.000 --> 03:45.190
in this place,

73
03:45.430 --> 03:47.360
doing all this nonsense every day!

74
03:47.680 --> 03:48.400
Go home!

75
03:49.070 --> 03:50.780
You are getting engaged to Miss Chen next month.

76
03:50.780 --> 03:52.850
Never touch any of this again.

77
03:53.630 --> 03:54.800
Who is this?

78
03:54.820 --> 03:55.910
The president of Zhiyuan Chamber of Commerce.

79
03:55.910 --> 03:57.840
I can't believe he's Lin's father.

80
04:04.830 --> 04:05.480
Dad,

81
04:05.840 --> 04:06.590
do you know how the Chen family

82
04:06.590 --> 04:08.030
made their fortune?

83
04:08.430 --> 04:09.630
Smuggling medicines

84
04:09.680 --> 04:10.680
and profiteering from the national crisis!

85
04:10.680 --> 04:11.000
You...

86
04:11.000 --> 04:11.530
And also,

87
04:12.150 --> 04:13.870
the family business you want me to inherit...

88
04:13.870 --> 04:16.430
the textile mills, grain stores, and pawnshops...

89
04:16.430 --> 04:17.640
you hoard supplies

90
04:17.760 --> 04:19.420
and tripled the price of rice!

91
04:19.630 --> 04:21.029
Did you think I didn't know?

92
04:21.029 --> 04:21.829
How dare you!

93
04:25.160 --> 04:27.610
Mr. Lin, this is an activity room.

94
04:27.920 --> 04:28.830
It's not a place for you to throw your weight around

95
04:28.830 --> 04:30.360
and handle family matters.

96
04:30.600 --> 04:31.560
Who do you think you are?

97
04:31.560 --> 04:32.270
Are you okay, Lin Huai?

98
04:32.270 --> 04:33.600
How dare you lecture me!

99
04:35.170 --> 04:36.120
I am his friend,

100
04:36.770 --> 04:39.570
and also one of "these people" you just mentioned.

101
04:40.270 --> 04:41.830
Since you're here

102
04:41.850 --> 04:43.440
and publicly insulted us,

103
04:43.760 --> 04:45.370
you should at least know

104
04:45.510 --> 04:47.159
what we actually do here.

105
04:51.920 --> 04:53.830
This is our schedule for the week.

106
04:53.990 --> 04:55.310
What we spread every day

107
04:55.310 --> 04:57.409
are messages about saving our nation.

108
04:57.409 --> 04:58.440
We raise funds for the soldiers

109
04:58.440 --> 05:01.200
on the front lines who lack food and clothing.

110
05:01.390 --> 05:02.740
It's where your medicine

111
05:02.740 --> 05:04.860
and rice should have gone.

112
05:06.820 --> 05:07.970
As for your son,

113
05:08.950 --> 05:10.000
Lin Huai,

114
05:11.640 --> 05:14.170
he is crying out for those who starved to death

115
05:14.640 --> 05:16.550
and those who froze to death.

116
05:16.840 --> 05:18.280
You should thank him.

117
05:18.650 --> 05:19.450
He runs around

118
05:19.560 --> 05:22.720
to save the country from peril.

119
05:22.720 --> 05:25.650
He has been accumulating virtue for your Lin family.

120
05:27.350 --> 05:28.310
I just don't know

121
05:29.050 --> 05:31.200
if it can keep up with the speed at which you lose it.

122
05:31.200 --> 05:32.050
You!

123
05:33.680 --> 05:34.480
Lin Huai!

124
05:35.800 --> 05:36.840
Every cent you spend

125
05:36.840 --> 05:38.310
belongs to the Lin family.

126
05:45.409 --> 05:47.530
Young Master, what are you doing?

127
05:48.240 --> 05:49.510
Please stop!

128
05:50.480 --> 05:51.000
Sir,

129
05:51.390 --> 05:52.430
the Young Master is still young

130
05:52.430 --> 05:53.040
and childish.

131
05:53.040 --> 05:54.120
Please calm down.

132
05:57.510 --> 05:58.640
You ungrateful son!

133
05:59.000 --> 06:00.480
What are you doing?

134
06:01.100 --> 06:02.180
You're right.

135
06:04.000 --> 06:05.240
I've been spending

136
06:05.240 --> 06:06.640
the dirty money you made.

137
06:08.030 --> 06:09.290
Right now, I don't have

138
06:10.490 --> 06:12.350
a single cent from the Lin family.

139
06:13.120 --> 06:14.360
And not a single thing

140
06:14.550 --> 06:16.010
bears the Lin family name.

141
06:17.510 --> 06:18.720
From now on,

142
06:19.660 --> 06:20.720
the Lin family and I

143
06:21.460 --> 06:23.070
are completely through.

144
06:24.680 --> 06:25.710
Baiwei, let's go.

145
06:28.040 --> 06:28.840
Young Master.

146
06:29.430 --> 06:30.240
Lin Huai!

147
06:30.830 --> 06:32.020
If you walk away today,

148
06:32.020 --> 06:33.220
don't ever come back!

149
07:01.800 --> 07:02.560
So?

150
07:04.520 --> 07:05.280
How do I look?

151
07:11.040 --> 07:11.990
I'm sorry.

152
07:16.920 --> 07:17.720
Not bad.

153
07:18.310 --> 07:19.750
Way better than your

154
07:19.750 --> 07:21.190
rich kid clothes.

155
07:21.770 --> 07:22.700
You bet.

156
07:23.480 --> 07:24.920
I bought this with the money

157
07:24.920 --> 07:26.800
from pulling Miss Baiwei's rickshaw.

158
07:26.800 --> 07:28.330
It feels amazing to wear it.

159
07:30.450 --> 07:31.650
Stop messing around.

160
07:33.530 --> 07:34.700
You know,

161
07:35.270 --> 07:37.190
you're pretty and sweet,

162
07:38.600 --> 07:39.390
and...

163
07:40.240 --> 07:42.440
you really know how to curse people out.

164
07:42.950 --> 07:43.880
In my whole life,

165
07:44.040 --> 07:46.100
I've never seen my dad so speechless.

166
07:47.070 --> 07:48.390
Is that a compliment?

167
07:49.310 --> 07:50.120
Obviously.

168
07:50.430 --> 07:51.750
You've got all three.

169
07:52.040 --> 07:52.920
How rare.

170
07:56.630 --> 07:59.530
♪ Do you see me? ♪

171
08:00.590 --> 08:03.280
♪ Do you hear me? ♪

172
08:03.600 --> 08:06.280
♪ Just take a step ♪

173
08:06.670 --> 08:11.030
♪ And try to see another way ♪

174
08:12.590 --> 08:15.530
♪ Do you see me? ♪

175
08:15.560 --> 08:19.050
♪ Do you hear me? ♪

176
08:19.510 --> 08:22.020
♪ Just take a step ♪

177
08:22.560 --> 08:27.020
♪ And try to see another day ♪

178
08:34.330 --> 08:38.370
♪ Another hero emerges ♪

179
08:38.390 --> 08:42.970
♪ Another hero emerges ♪

180
08:43.600 --> 08:44.390
Baiwei.

181
08:47.510 --> 08:48.360
What's wrong?

182
08:50.350 --> 08:54.190
♪ Another hero emerges ♪

183
08:54.530 --> 09:01.440
♪ To save the day ♪

184
08:55.000 --> 08:56.060
It's snowing hard.

185
08:57.000 --> 08:57.840
Let's go.

186
09:00.520 --> 09:01.400
Let's go.

187
09:03.070 --> 09:06.690
♪ Do you see me? ♪

188
09:07.080 --> 09:09.370
♪ Do you hear me? ♪

189
09:09.500 --> 09:12.440
♪ Just take a step ♪

190
09:12.770 --> 09:14.640
♪ Don't let me down ♪

191
09:15.200 --> 09:19.030
♪ Don't let me down ♪

192
09:19.210 --> 09:22.980
♪ Do you see me? ♪

193
09:23.580 --> 09:25.730
♪ Do you hear me? ♪

194
09:25.760 --> 09:28.180
♪ Just take a step ♪

195
09:28.330 --> 09:30.330
♪ Don't let me down ♪

196
09:31.130 --> 09:34.510
♪ Don't let me down ♪

197
09:41.520 --> 09:42.280
Awesome!

198
09:42.300 --> 09:43.960
Just in time for the premiere.

199
09:46.320 --> 09:47.440
I gotta get back to work.

200
09:47.440 --> 09:48.520
Let's leave together tonight.

201
09:48.520 --> 09:49.130
Okay.

202
10:34.240 --> 10:34.970
Look at this.

203
10:35.820 --> 10:36.580
Please.

204
10:43.030 --> 10:44.320
Drawing is exhausting.

205
10:44.320 --> 10:45.030
Look at me.

206
10:45.430 --> 10:46.430
Give me a smile.

207
10:48.990 --> 10:49.750
Lin Huai,

208
10:50.550 --> 10:52.000
how old are you?

209
11:00.150 --> 11:00.980
My pen.

210
11:02.000 --> 11:03.390
I need to draw.

211
11:03.390 --> 11:04.030
Call me brother,

212
11:04.030 --> 11:05.750
call me brother and it's yours.

213
11:05.750 --> 11:06.700
Give it back.

214
11:06.750 --> 11:08.280
Then you have to draw for me.

215
11:08.600 --> 11:10.000
Call me brother and I will.

216
11:10.000 --> 11:10.630
Or no pen for you.

217
11:10.630 --> 11:11.790
In your dreams!

218
11:11.790 --> 11:12.310
Hey!

219
11:12.330 --> 11:13.730
I have a deadline!

220
11:14.750 --> 11:15.750
Lin Huai,

221
11:16.460 --> 11:17.860
aren't you

222
11:19.900 --> 11:20.760
a bit childish?

223
11:58.420 --> 11:59.230
Baiwei,

224
12:01.240 --> 12:02.840
I really love you.

225
12:03.430 --> 12:04.550
I love you so much.

226
12:06.650 --> 12:07.810
My life

227
12:08.550 --> 12:09.960
was empty and dull.

228
12:10.310 --> 12:11.840
But falling in love with you

229
12:13.040 --> 12:14.440
made it shine.

230
12:18.840 --> 12:21.040
I can't promise you a lifetime of peace,

231
12:22.910 --> 12:24.370
instead, I'm begging you.

232
12:25.030 --> 12:26.290
Begging you to grant me

233
12:28.260 --> 12:29.620
this endless honor.

234
12:41.820 --> 12:43.030
Please marry me.

235
12:45.030 --> 12:46.440
Let me stay by your side

236
12:48.030 --> 12:49.510
lifetime after lifetime.

237
12:54.360 --> 13:06.510
Marry him!

238
13:24.270 --> 13:25.110
Look.

239
13:26.080 --> 13:28.810
This is our marriage certificate from back then.

240
13:29.890 --> 13:31.730
Do you really not remember?

241
13:33.930 --> 13:35.100
No, I don't.

242
13:36.310 --> 13:37.580
You show up here today

243
13:37.870 --> 13:39.000
with some photos

244
13:39.000 --> 13:40.120
and a video,

245
13:40.240 --> 13:42.040
make up some century-old story,

246
13:42.660 --> 13:43.990
and expect me to believe

247
13:45.390 --> 13:48.390
that we are Song Baiwei and Lin Huai from a century ago?

248
13:50.440 --> 13:52.090
It's absurd.

249
13:58.650 --> 13:59.820
I'm sorry.

250
14:00.650 --> 14:02.370
I'm not feeling well.

251
14:03.120 --> 14:04.280
You should leave.

252
14:08.220 --> 14:09.100
Wait.

253
14:16.390 --> 14:17.840
I never once mentioned

254
14:17.840 --> 14:19.140
the name Song Baiwei.

255
14:26.820 --> 14:27.700
You remember.

256
14:29.050 --> 14:31.110
You remember everything, don't you?

257
14:32.870 --> 14:34.870
Why are you pretending not to know me?

258
14:34.870 --> 14:36.760
We've known each other for so long.

259
14:36.760 --> 14:38.790
Why...

260
14:40.320 --> 14:41.630
Tell me.

261
14:44.510 --> 14:45.440
Lin Huai...

262
14:48.120 --> 14:50.780
About that marriage certificate you gave me...

263
14:50.930 --> 14:52.130
I thought it over.

264
14:53.270 --> 14:55.120
Let's get through the fundraiser first.

265
14:55.120 --> 14:55.750
It's okay.

266
14:56.080 --> 14:57.360
When all this is over,

267
14:58.490 --> 14:59.950
I'll wait for your answer.

268
15:08.600 --> 15:10.400
Why is the rain getting so heavy?

269
15:11.630 --> 15:12.760
Where are you going?

270
15:14.520 --> 15:15.580
I'll be right back.

271
15:15.580 --> 15:16.540
Wait for me here.

272
16:59.590 --> 17:00.830
So tragic.

273
17:02.870 --> 17:04.480
What happened?

274
17:04.619 --> 17:06.140
Who would do this?

275
17:06.960 --> 17:08.160
Does anyone know him?

276
17:08.440 --> 17:10.170
No one's even here for his body.

277
17:12.319 --> 17:13.119
Yeah.

278
17:13.140 --> 17:14.339
Poor guy.

279
17:16.069 --> 17:17.109
Exactly.

280
17:17.109 --> 17:18.310
He must've crossed the wrong people

281
17:18.310 --> 17:19.369
for this to happen.

282
17:33.560 --> 17:34.350
Lin Huai.

283
17:34.730 --> 17:35.530
Lin Huai.

284
17:36.830 --> 17:37.640
Lin Huai!

285
17:38.440 --> 17:39.510
Lin Huai!

286
17:42.110 --> 17:43.110
Help!

287
17:43.440 --> 17:44.680
Help!

288
17:44.680 --> 17:45.960
Somebody help!

289
17:46.440 --> 17:47.550
Lin Huai!

290
17:48.510 --> 17:49.350
Lin Huai!

291
18:08.790 --> 18:10.480
Help!

292
18:12.720 --> 18:15.350
Get a doctor!

293
18:18.200 --> 18:19.850
Lin Huai!

294
18:22.240 --> 18:23.550
Lin Huai!

295
18:25.830 --> 18:27.160
Let's get you to a hospital.

296
18:27.160 --> 18:28.640
Let's get to a hospital.

297
18:28.940 --> 18:30.350
Lin Huai, don't...

298
18:30.570 --> 18:32.370
Don't die on me.

299
18:32.400 --> 18:34.600
Please don't die.

300
19:12.760 --> 19:13.850
Lin Huai!

301
19:13.880 --> 19:15.440
The Lin Huai in my memory

302
19:16.660 --> 19:18.520
died on the street just like that.

303
19:20.400 --> 19:22.510
He died at the age of twenty.

304
19:23.400 --> 19:25.200
His body was cold.

305
19:26.110 --> 19:27.920
He never woke up again.

306
19:31.870 --> 19:33.800
Why are you pretending not to know me?

307
19:33.800 --> 19:35.660
We've known each other for so long.

308
19:35.660 --> 19:37.770
Why...

309
19:38.310 --> 19:39.590
Tell me.

310
19:43.240 --> 19:44.090
Lin Huai.

311
19:44.130 --> 19:44.930
Director Lin.
